Version: 2.1.0-3
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: AmogOS
Depends: plymouth, initramfs-tools, python3, fonts-dejavu-core, xdg-user-dirs
Replaces: amogos-installer (<< 0.1.5)
Description: Persistent AmogOS boot theme and system defaults
